OL,3,GNEWSAPolice attacked and vehicle set on
OL,4,Afire at teen's vigil
OL,5,
OL,6,FFireworks were thrown at police
OL,7,Fofficers and a vehicle was set on fire
OL,8,Fin disorder linked to a vigil for a
OL,9,Fteenager who died in a crash, police
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FNorthumbria police said the
OL,13,F"unacceptable behaviour" happened at a
OL,14,Fplanned balloon release in memory of a
OL,15,F16-year-old boy in the Beaconhill
OL,16,FGrange area of Cramlington,
OL,17,FNorthumberland, at about 16:00 on
OL,18,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
