OL,3,GNEWSAPolice attacked and vehicle set on
OL,4,Afire at teen's vigil
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force did not name the boy but said
OL,7,Fhis death was not connected to seven
OL,8,Fpeople killed in a crash on the A66 in
OL,9,FMiddlesbrough last month, with disorder
OL,10,Falso reported at vigils linked to their
OL,11,Fdeaths.
OL,13,FIt is understood the teenager died on
OL,14,F24 August on the A196 near Stobhill in
OL,15,FMorpeth when a car and a motorbike
OL,16,Fcrashed at a junction.
